\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.5}{\ignorespaces Spurious signal test results at 1.65 $fb^{-1}$ for signal process (a) VcXH, (b) VzWW, (c) Wprime, (d) DarkJets. The quantity on the x-axis is the true mass of the signal hypothesis, while the y-axis is the fitted amount of signal $S_{spur}$ in the upper pad and the ratio $S_{spur}/\sigma _{fit}$ in the lower pad. In all cases, the requirements of $S_{spur}/\sigma _{fit}$ within $\pm $ 0.5 are satisfied and this test can be considered passed.}}{103}{figure.caption.107}\protected@file@percent }
